ng a refreshing dip in the palm-fringed infinity pool, kayaking the length of the island, being pampered at the award-winning spa or finding your spot among the palms and volcanic rocks scattered on Aitutaki's secluded beachfront.15:["$","div",null,{"className":"main-content","children":["$","$L18",null,{"hotels":[{"vendor_name":"Pacific Resort Aitutaki","offer_country_name":"Cook Islands","location_heading":"Aitutaki","title":"Cook Islands Luxury: Aitutaki Beachfront Hideaway with Daily Breakfast, Three Dinners & Transfers","description":"In the heart of the shimmering South Pacific lies the beautifully remote Pacific Resort Aitutaki. A short flight from Rarotonga, the serene blue-green lagoon, nodding palm trees and crystal-clear skies of this five-star escape will take your breath away. The resort is a true taste of heaven, with just 29 intimate thatched beachfront bungalows delivering unparalleled seclusion and hospitality. One of only two Cook Islands resorts included in the prestigious Small Luxury Hotels of the World collection, this far-flung island paradise is yours to enjoy at your own pace. Whether that's taking a refreshing dip in the palm-fringed infinity pool, kayaking the length of the island, being pampered at the onsite spa or finding your spot among the palms on Aitutaki's secluded beachfront, you're sure to find your bliss in this divine corner of the world.","location_subheading":"Cook Islands","price":2239,"original_price":5892,"discount_percentage":62,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/006RF00000J4zd3YAB","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/1kwjzsnq7ql852b3h2u","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/j2wx9cz6so5qyyel7hci","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/dosgo69prngrrmj9c33","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 1","min_duration":5,"end_date_utc":"2025-08-19 13:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Aitutaki Lagoon Private Island Resort","offer_country_name":"Cook Islands","location_heading":"Aitutaki","title":"Adults-Only Co